{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/792987-listening-to-science-of-murder","id":792987,"title":"Listening to: \"Science of Murder:\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-26T00:05:50-08:00","id":792987,"title":"Listening to: \"Science of Murder:\"","content":"Realizing that no matter how dark or horror we play this games, man can be far more so. Also, realizing that the brain is very interesting organ, and that brain damage might be apart of why people commit these horrid acts of murder, cannibalism, and other acts against eachother. The reason why I am bring all this up is at what point in games do you take a step back and go that just to fall?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10388,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10388-madfox","user":"MadFox","date":". 12-26-2015, 03:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10388-madfox","name":"MadFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10388_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-26T00:27:26-08:00","id":793001,"title":"","content":"What do you mean by, &quot;to fall?&quot;<br /> <br /> Also.. I'd be very wary of the idea of conflating brain damage to any sort of violent behaviors. The physical state of someone's brain (whether genetic or environmental in its current condition) is, of course, a potential part of any behavior they engage in. But you can't scan someone's brain and say, &quot;Oh, that's why they did [whatever bad thing].&quot; How we come to the specific actions we do, is always far more complicated than that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-26T01:20:41-08:00","id":793022,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar617_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"617\" data-vbnamecard=\"617\">Heavy Arms</a> I meant &quot;too far&quot; thanks for catching that.<br /> True, however I was relating to what I was listening to, and comparing it to some of the stories in the world of darkness, and wondering at what point is too far for most players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10388-madfox","name":"MadFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10388_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-26T07:34:14-08:00","id":793076,"title":"","content":"IME I don't think there's any good way to classify what's too far for most players. Everyone's comfort levels are radically different, and you can't count on X being on the table, so Y should be safe. What is too far for individuals is largely emotional, and even if they intellectually accept that something is too much for them despite externally being very minor compared to something else that's far more horrific, it's still too much for them and makes the game unfun to include.<br /> <br /> That said, the highly Victorian association of sinners with the mentally unhealthy that was fairly hard coded into VtM's Humanity, and nWOD 1e's Morality (aka the whole brain damage thing) is something that is often seen as fairly distasteful even if it isn't something as gut-reaction heavy has including sexual violence in games. There's basically two distinct issues of the game hard-coding outdated (and esp. problematic) elements into the themes of the game, and stuff we choose to include.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}